Z||000008||Rick 88||09-15-2001||10:33 PM||||Master Sushi,<P>These figures are taken right out of the 1988 Pontiac "The Hot Ones" High Performance Handbook vol LXIII. At the bottom of the specs it say, "NOTE All performance figues obtained with professional driver on General Motors closed test area"<P>Maybe we should consider a GTA brake upgrade!<BR>Honestly the figures are not that bad considering the power to weight ratio. Also brakes tend to be less efficient on a brand new unbroken in vehicle. I'm sure the performance figures on a fully broken in vehicle would be better also.<P>Rick<BR>yellow 88 GT 5-speed. (I won't race Sunbird Turbo 5-speeds)<P>||||reg||1
